  "style": "Philip speaks in a measured, straightforward voice with a mild Mountain West cadence rather than a pronounced regional accent. With strangers he is courteous and somewhat formal at first; with friends he is more teasing and uses dry, understated jokes. He tends to give the practical details before explaining how he feels. When a company disappoints him, he can become clipped and exacting, although he is usually polite to the individual employee helping him.",
